  << /ActualText (Seller\220s Actions \050FinTech\051\054 Middle SWE\nArchitecture \046 Leadership\072\nRedesigned PostgreSQL sharding strategy\056 Average number of live connections dropped from 50 to 30\056 Largest table row count reduced  by 90\045\nCoordinated 2 teams \050analytics and development\051 during Kafka events API migration\056 The change resulted in reducing latency by 50\045 in p50\054 by 80\045 in p90\054 and by 90\045 in p99\nConducted over 30 technical interviews\056 Hired 3 Go devs for our team\nDevelopment\072\nMaintained Go\055microservices product serving 5\054000\053 RPS\nBuilt an API that allows sellers to communicate with the system via Excel\nMigrated PostgreSQL \050re\055implemented all queues\054 implemented migrator\051\nReduced architectural technical debt and removed legacy components\072\nOperations\072\nCreated GitLab CI pipelines such as ProtoLint static check\nDuty\072 Incident \050on\055call\051 and operations \050asynchronous help in chat\051)
